  "emailBody": "\n        <html>\n\n        <body\n            style=\"\n                font-family:Segoe UI, Arial, sans-serif;\n                margin:20px;\n            \"\n        >\n\n            <div\n                style=\"\n                    background:#d42e12;\n                    color:white;\n                    padding:15px;\n                    border-radius:8px;\n                \"\n            >\n\n\n               <h1 style=\"margin:0;\">\n                    Fuel Market Intelligence Evening Report\n                </h1>\n\n                <p style=\"margin:5px 0 0 0;\">\n                    29 July 2026\n                </p>\n\n            </div>\n\n            <p\n                style=\"\n                    font-size:16px;\n                    margin-top:20px;\n                    margin-bottom:20px;\n                \"\n            >\n                Good evening Sir,\n                <br><br>\n                \n                Here is today's fuel market intelligence report highlighting\n                the latest PMS and AGO depot prices together with key industry\n                developments and market news.\n            </p>\n\n            <br>\n\n            \n        <h2 style=\"color:#d42e12;\">\n            PMS Prices\n        </h2>\n\n        <div\n            style=\"\n                background:#fad5a1;\n                padding:12px;\n                border-left:5px solid #f28e05;\n                margin-bottom:10px;\n                font-size:16px;\n                font-weight:bold;\n            \"\n        >\n            Average PMS Prices: ₦1,219.88/L\n        </div>\n\n        <table\n            width=\"100%\"\n            cellspacing=\"0\"\n            cellpadding=\"10\"\n            style=\"\n                border-collapse:collapse;\n                border:1px solid #ddd;\n            \"\n        >\n\n            <tr style=\"background:#d42e12;color:white;\">\n                <th align=\"left\">Depot</th>\n                <th align=\"left\">Price</th>\n            </tr>\n\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>DANGOTE</td>\n                <td>₦1,215.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>HEYDEN</td>\n                <td>₦1,220.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>ARDOVA</td>\n                <td>₦1,218.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>NIPCO LAGOS</td>\n                <td>₦1,217.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>PINNACLE</td>\n                <td>₦1,216.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>TECHNO OIL</td>\n                <td>₦1,216.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>MRS TINCAN</td>\n                <td>₦1,222.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>BULK STRATEGIC</td>\n                <td>₦1,235.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n\n        </table>\n\n        <br>\n        \n\n            \n        <h2 style=\"color:#d42e12;\">\n            AGO Prices\n        </h2>\n\n        <div\n            style=\"\n                background:#fad5a1;\n                padding:12px;\n                border-left:5px solid #f28e05;\n                margin-bottom:10px;\n                font-size:16px;\n                font-weight:bold;\n            \"\n        >\n            Average AGO Prices: ₦1,650.62/L\n        </div>\n\n        <table\n            width=\"100%\"\n            cellspacing=\"0\"\n            cellpadding=\"10\"\n            style=\"\n                border-collapse:collapse;\n                border:1px solid #ddd;\n            \"\n        >\n\n            <tr style=\"background:#d42e12;color:white;\">\n                <th align=\"left\">Depot</th>\n                <th align=\"left\">Price</th>\n            </tr>\n\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>PRUDENT OGHARA</td>\n                <td>₦1,650.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>AITEO</td>\n                <td>₦1,655.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>WOSBAB</td>\n                <td>₦1,650.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>GULF TREASURE</td>\n                <td>₦1,650.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>INTERGRATED</td>\n                <td>₦1,650.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>AFRICAN TERMINAL</td>\n                <td>₦1,650.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>DUPORT</td>\n                <td>₦1,650.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>IBACHEM</td>\n                <td>₦1,650.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n\n        </table>\n\n        <br>\n        \n\n            \n        <h2 style=\"color:#d42e12;\">\n            Market News\n        </h2>\n        \n            <div\n                style=\"\n                    border:1px solid #fad5a1;\n                    padding:15px;\n                    margin-bottom:15px;\n                    border-radius:8px;\n                    \n                \"\n            >\n\n                <h3>\n                    Diesel Depot Prices Rise as Brent Crude Surges to Nearly $90\n                </h3>\n\n                <p>\n                    Diesel depot prices have started climbing across major Nigerian supply hubs as Brent crude surged to nearly $90 per barrel. The rebound in crude prices followed renewed geopolitical tensions involving the United States, Saudi Arabia and Iran.\n                </p>\n\n                <a\n                    href=\"https://petroleumprice.ng/news/articles/diesel-depot-prices-rise-as-brent-crude-surges-to-nearly-90\"\n                    target=\"_blank\"\n                    style=\"\n                        color:#d42e12;\n                        font-weight:bold;\n                        text-decoration:none;\n                    \"\n                >\n                    Full Article →\n                </a>\n\n            </div>\n            \n            <div\n                style=\"\n                    border:1px solid #fad5a1;\n                    padding:15px;\n                    margin-bottom:15px;\n                    border-radius:8px;\n                    \n                \"\n            >\n\n                <h3>\n                    OPEC+ Set to End Monthly Output Hikes After September Increase\n                </h3>\n\n                <p>\n                    OPEC+ is expected to approve one final oil production increase for September before suspending its monthly output adjustments for the remainder of the year. The planned adjustment would mirror the production increases implemented in June, July and August. If adopted, the decision would leave an additional 2 million bpd of broader OPEC+ production cuts in place through the end of this year.\n                </p>\n\n                <a\n                    href=\"https://petroleumprice.ng/news/articles/opec-set-to-end-monthly-output-hikes-after-september-increase\"\n                    target=\"_blank\"\n                    style=\"\n                        color:#d42e12;\n                        font-weight:bold;\n                        text-decoration:none;\n                    \"\n                >\n                    Full Article →\n                </a>\n\n            </div>\n            \n            <div\n                style=\"\n                    border:1px solid #fad5a1;\n                    padding:15px;\n                    margin-bottom:15px;\n                    border-radius:8px;\n                    \n                \"\n            >\n\n                <h3>\n                    Pivot Energy Opens ₦100bn Commercial Paper, Offers Returns of Up to 24.5%\n                </h3>\n\n                <p>\n                    Pivot Integrated Energy Services Limited has opened its ₦100 billion Series 1 Commercial Paper offer. Pivot is one of 20 approved off-takers under the Dangote Refinery PMS Consortium, with an allocated target volume of 300 million litres per quarter.\n                </p>\n\n                <a\n                    href=\"https://petroleumprice.ng/news/articles/pivot-energy-opens-100bn-commercial-paper-offers-returns-of-up-to-245\"\n                    target=\"_blank\"\n                    style=\"\n                        color:#d42e12;\n                        font-weight:bold;\n                        text-decoration:none;\n                    \"\n                >\n                    Full Article →\n                </a>\n\n            </div>\n            \n            <div\n                style=\"\n                    border:1px solid #fad5a1;\n                    padding:15px;\n                    margin-bottom:15px;\n                    border-radius:8px;\n                    \n                \"\n            >\n\n                <h3>\n                    DAPPMAN Alleges Selective Fuel Import Licence Allocations, Seeks Reps' Intervention\n                </h3>\n\n                <p>\n                    The Depot and Petroleum Products Marketers Association of Nigeria (DAPPMAN) has accused the Nigerian Midstream and Downstream Petroleum Regulatory Authority of repeatedly allocating fuel import licences to the same group of marketers. The allegation was made on Tuesday during an interactive session organised by the House Committee on Petroleum Resources (Downstream)\n                </p>\n\n                <a\n                    href=\"https://petroleumprice.ng/news/articles/dappman-alleges-selective-fuel-import-licence-allocations-seeks-reps-intervention\"\n                    target=\"_blank\"\n                    style=\"\n                        color:#d42e12;\n                        font-weight:bold;\n                        text-decoration:none;\n                    \"\n                >\n                    Full Article →\n                </a>\n\n            </div>\n            \n            <div\n                style=\"\n                    border:1px solid #fad5a1;\n                    padding:15px;\n                    margin-bottom:15px;\n                    border-radius:8px;\n                    \n                \"\n            >\n\n                <h3>\n                    JUST IN: Brent Crude Jumps 4% to $87 After Iran strikes U.S Military\n                </h3>\n\n                <p>\n                    Brent crude was trading at $87.59 per barrel, up 4.16 per cent. West Texas Intermediate (WTI) stood at $82.53 per barrel,. representing a 4.13 per cent gain. The latest rally comes barely 24 hours after oil prices retreated.\n                </p>\n\n                <a\n                    href=\"https://petroleumprice.ng/news/articles/just-in-brent-crude-jumps-4-to-87-after-iran-strikes-us-military\"\n                    target=\"_blank\"\n                    style=\"\n                        color:#d42e12;\n                        font-weight:bold;\n                        text-decoration:none;\n                    \"\n                >\n                    Full Article →\n                </a>\n\n            </div>\n            \n\n        </body>\n\n        </html>\n        "
